<section id="gtxChatCommandGuide"
         class="gtx-chat-command-guide"
         aria-label="Chat command guide"
         role="dialog"
         hidden>
    <header class="gtx-chat-command-guide-header">
        <div>
            <strong>What can I ask?</strong>
            <div>Tap an example to try it, or type a similar request.</div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="gtx-chat-icon-button gtx-chat-guide-close" data-chat-help-close aria-label="Close command guide">
            <i class="bi bi-x-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-list">
        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-note">
            <i class="bi bi-lightbulb" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div><strong>Ask</strong> what is available to see cards here. Use <strong>Open</strong> or <strong>Take me to</strong> when you want to visit a page.</div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="gtx-chat-command-guide-group">
            <button type="button" data-chat-guide-toggle aria-expanded="true">
                <i class="bi bi-search" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>Search live inventory</span>
                <i class="bi bi-chevron-down gtx-chat-guide-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="What trucks are available?">
                &quot;What trucks are available?&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i> Shows available trucks as vehicle cards inside the chat.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="What Honda vehicles are available under $20,000?">
                &quot;What Honda vehicles are available under $20,000?&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-currency-dollar" aria-hidden="true"></i> Combines make and maximum-price filters.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Find vehicles with a manual transmission">
                &quot;Find vehicles with a manual transmission&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-gear-wide-connected" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches manual, automatic, or CVT transmissions.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Show me red vehicles">
                &quot;Show me red vehicles&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-palette" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches exterior and interior vehicle colors.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Do you have any 6-cylinder SUVs?">
                &quot;Do you have any 6-cylinder SUVs?&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches exact cylinder counts; requests such as V6 and V8 also work.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Show me red automatic vehicles with 6 cylinders under $25,000">
                &quot;Show me red automatic vehicles with 6 cylinders under $25,000&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-filter-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> Combines color, transmission, cylinders, and maximum price in one search.</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="gtx-chat-command-guide-group">
            <button type="button" data-chat-guide-toggle aria-expanded="true">
                <i class="bi bi-database-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>Search DataOne specifications</span>
                <i class="bi bi-chevron-down gtx-chat-guide-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-note">
            <i class="bi bi-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>When DataOne details are available, you can search by <strong>doors, horsepower, city or highway MPG, seating capacity, and standard equipment</strong>.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Show me four-door vehicles with heated seats">
                &quot;Show me four-door vehicles with heated seats&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-car-front" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches DataOne door and standard-equipment details when available.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Find two-door vehicles">
                &quot;Find two-door vehicles&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-door-closed" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches for an exact DataOne door count.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Show me vehicles with at least 250 horsepower">
                &quot;Show me vehicles with at least 250 horsepower&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge" aria-hidden="true"></i> Finds vehicles meeting a minimum DataOne horsepower rating.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Find vehicles with at least 300 horsepower and 25 highway MPG">
                &quot;Find vehicles with at least 300 horsepower and 25 highway MPG&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-speedometer2" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches DataOne horsepower and EPA mileage specifications.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Find vehicles with at least 25 city MPG">
                &quot;Find vehicles with at least 25 city MPG&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-buildings" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches the minimum DataOne EPA city mileage rating.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Show me vehicles with at least 30 highway MPG">
                &quot;Show me vehicles with at least 30 highway MPG&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-signpost-split" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches the minimum DataOne EPA highway mileage rating.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Show me vehicles that seat at least 7 people">
                &quot;Show me vehicles that seat at least 7 people&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-people" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches DataOne seating or passenger-capacity specifications.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Do you have vehicles with blind spot monitoring?">
                &quot;Do you have vehicles with blind spot monitoring?&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches verified DataOne standard safety equipment.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Find vehicles with Apple CarPlay">
                &quot;Find vehicles with Apple CarPlay&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i> Searches verified DataOne standard technology equipment.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Show me vehicles with a sunroof and heated seats">
                &quot;Show me vehicles with a sunroof and heated seats&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-stars" aria-hidden="true"></i> Combines multiple DataOne standard-equipment features.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Find four-door vehicles with at least 200 horsepower and 30 highway MPG">
                &quot;Find four-door vehicles with at least 200 horsepower and 30 highway MPG&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-sliders2" aria-hidden="true"></i> Combines DataOne doors, horsepower, and highway MPG.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-note">
            <i class="bi bi-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>DataOne coverage varies by vehicle. Start with <strong>Show me</strong>, <strong>Find</strong>, or <strong>Do you have</strong> to display matching cards in chat.</div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="gtx-chat-command-guide-group">
            <button type="button" data-chat-guide-toggle aria-expanded="true">
                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>Open pages and filters</span>
                <i class="bi bi-chevron-down gtx-chat-guide-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Open SUV inventory under $20,000">
                &quot;Open SUV inventory under $20,000&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-funnel" aria-hidden="true"></i> Opens the SUV page with a maximum-price filter.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Take me to the inventory for Honda under 2020">
                &quot;Take me to the inventory for Honda under 2020&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-calendar3" aria-hidden="true"></i> Opens Honda inventory from model year 2019 or earlier.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Clear inventory filters">
                &quot;Clear inventory filters&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i> Returns to the unfiltered All Inventory page.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Open this vehicle">
                &quot;Open this vehicle&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> Opens the vehicle when the latest result contains one match.</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="gtx-chat-command-guide-group">
            <button type="button" data-chat-guide-toggle aria-expanded="true">
                <i class="bi bi-building" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span>Dealership help</span>
                <i class="bi bi-chevron-down gtx-chat-guide-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="What are your hours Saturday?">
                &quot;What are your hours Saturday?&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> Checks the current dealership schedule.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Take me to the financing application">
                &quot;Take me to the financing application&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text" aria-hidden="true"></i> Opens the online financing application.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-prompt="Open the staff page">
                &quot;Open the staff page&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-people" aria-hidden="true"></i> Opens the GTX team page.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gtx-chat-command-guide-item">
            <button type="button" data-chat-contact>
                &quot;Contact sales&quot;
            </button>
            <span><i class="bi bi-person-lines-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> Opens the sales contact form.</span>
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer class="gtx-chat-command-guide-tip">
        <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        Use the Up and Down arrow keys in the message box to browse your last 20 requests.
    </footer>
</section>
